efore any scored run (sae-lead, after the rehearsal, job 62745): shard_hours_max 2 -> 6. The projection prices every search at the cap at the do-nothing's 512-window speed (0.88 s per K* and 1.23 s per stand-in evaluation, about 4.9 h per built item), so 2 h stopped every job; the copy-window items run at 0.21 s (about 56 min at the cap, inside the debug 2 h --time), and new_few and new_thin run on H100 pods, where 6 h is the gated-run limit. No rule, band or prediction changed."}
